# Runtime environment for the {{service}} container.
#
# `dck setup` copies this file to .env (mode 0600, gitignored) when it is
# missing. Put secrets in .env only, never in this example. Format: KEY=value,
# no shell expansion. Changes apply on the next `dck up --recreate`; sessions
# opened over ssh see them through the entrypoint's environment profile.
#
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
